{"name": "Infamous Keepers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/9257d94f3b3224a9d66148d9676b1d5f.poster.avif?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/9257d94f3b3224a9d66148d9676b1d5f.webm?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/9257d94f3b3224a9d66148d9676b1d5f.mp4?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infamous Keepers is a Tower Defense/Tactical Roguelite set in the Legend of Keepers universe where you play as a Dungeon Keeper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your employer, the Dungeon Company, has recently gone through massive layoffs, putting their dungeons to the test by closing the portals that connect them. <br/>Cut off from any outside help, prove that your dungeon can still be successful and turn a profit: if a team of heroes makes it all the way through, you can kiss your career goodbye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/adaa9c8b5b73754e425c9d22aecb3426.poster.avif?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/adaa9c8b5b73754e425c9d22aecb3426.webm?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/adaa9c8b5b73754e425c9d22aecb3426.mp4?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"62\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/0e45dd4dc959894579edaca5104a3dd5.webp?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategically Place Your Towers and Traps</strong>: Give a warm welcome to your dungeon's \"visitors\"\u2014floors and walls are all fair game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get the Most from Your Employees</strong>: Send them to the front lines to slow enemies down or assign them to a tower to boost its stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolve to Survive</strong>: Unlock a variety of upgrades for your employees and use Relics to make your dungeon unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/8282ddbd1773e85df6eb5d452988ebcc.poster.avif?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/8282ddbd1773e85df6eb5d452988ebcc.webm?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/8282ddbd1773e85df6eb5d452988ebcc.mp4?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"62\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/cf18a6178c1f0b128c9b810d1b872ad6.webp?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's more to being a Keeper than just setting traps. You'll have to make pragmatic and often cruel decisions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Your Schedule</strong>: Once an assault is over, decide what to do next. Recruit monsters, buy towers and traps, trade resources, or sell your lowest-performing employees into slavery for rare items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fine-Tune Your Defenses</strong>: From young heroes thirsting for adventure to out-of-control mutant rats, you'll face a wide variety of enemies, forcing you to tailor your strategy to each threat\u2026 and to pray to Golthor that the strongest Cult Champions won't attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do More with Less</strong>: In addition to the regular day-to-day management of your dungeon, be prepared for random events whose consequences can be rather\u2026 unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/80ffe8f54127d4dad1d8bcb59ba64ff5.poster.avif?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/80ffe8f54127d4dad1d8bcb59ba64ff5.webm?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/80ffe8f54127d4dad1d8bcb59ba64ff5.mp4?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"62\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/a48d07e9bee7d1d72587395d4614bbab.webp?t=1782746228\" width=\"700\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If any intruders manage to sneak past your defenses, take care of them yourself!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Last Line of Defense</strong>: Wait deep in the heart of your lair, ready for action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Spells</strong>: Different types of Keepers have different spells that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become a Legend</strong>: Grow stronger and become an unstoppable force feared by all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/3505e161f6a310a20c66dcb1acdf88c4.poster.avif?t=1782746228\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/3505e161f6a310a20c66dcb1acdf88c4.webm?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/extras/3505e161f6a310a20c66dcb1acdf88c4.mp4?t=1782746228\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Defend your dungeon AND your job! Tower Defense meets Roguelite in Infamous Keepers. Use strategy and some clever trickery to defeat waves of enemies: set up towers and deadly traps, send your employees into the line of fire, and slaughter any intruders left standing yourself.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4502750/4f5d7df2404dd19bfefaedd9c5fd606ba222c4b8/header.jpg?t=1782746228", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Roguelite", "Dungeon Crawler", "Building", "Tactical", "Dark Fantasy"], "developers": "Goblinz Studio", "publishers": "Goblinz Studio", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4502750", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 June 2026 